    affiliation: "Bundesanstalt für Materialforschung und -prüfung (BAM)"
abstract: >-
  The guidance document for the Digital Reference Material Document (DRMD), the XML format for
  reference material certificates and product information sheets aligned with ISO 33401:2024. It
  explains every element of the DRMD XML Schema 1.0.0, with its business rules and examples, for
  producers, laboratories, software developers and auditors.
keywords:
  - reference materials
  - ISO 33401
  - digital certificate
  - XML Schema
  - metrology
  - quality infrastructure
